# Batch convert Markdown to HTML

## Windows

Use this command in CMD:

for %f in (docs\*.md) do mup-js "%f" -o "build\%~nf.html"

## macOS / Linux

Use this command in Terminal:

for f in docs/*.md; do mup-js "$f" -o "build/$(basename "$f" .md).html"; done

@tip
Both commands convert all .md files in the docs folder to HTML in the build folder.
@end